#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:2
msgid "Version 4.0.4"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:4
msgid "Release Date: July 15, 2020"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:6
msgid "**4.0.4 release of CodeIgniter4**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:13
msgid "BREAKING"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:15
msgid ""
"Added ``$arguments`` parameter to ``after()`` and ``before()`` in "
"``FilterInterface``. This is a breaking change, so all code implementing "
"the ``FilterInterface`` must be updated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:18
msgid "Enhancements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:20
msgid ""
"The location for the SQLite3 database has changed and by default will be "
"now located in a ``writable`` folder instead of the ``public`` folder."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:21
msgid ""
"New CLI command: ``cache:clear`` that will destroy all data within the "
"current cache engine."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:22
msgid ""
"Thanks to samsonasik, we have several libraries brought up to 100% test "
"coverage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:23
msgid "A few small performance increases. Every ounce matters!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:24
msgid ""
"``getFieldData()`` in the database results class now returns column type "
"and length."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:25
msgid "Default .htaccess file updated to work better with extended characters."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:26
msgid ""
"New Testing Feature: :doc:`Fabricator </testing/fabricator>` makes "
"creating mock classes simple and repeatable in your tests."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:27
msgid ""
"Model class can now have the callbacks overridden at runtime. Useful for "
"testing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:28
msgid ""
"A number of improvements to :doc:`Feature Tests </testing/feature>` in "
"general."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:29
msgid ""
"New :doc:`command() helper function </cli/spark_commands>` to "
"programatically run your CLI commands. Useful for testing and cron jobs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:30
msgid ""
"New command, ``make:seeder`` to generate a :doc:`Database Seed class "
"</dbmgmt/seeds>` skeleton file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:31
msgid ""
"Colors now available on the CLI within Windows, as well as other Windows-"
"related CLI improvements."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:32
msgid ""
"New helper :doc:`mb_url_title() </helpers/url_helper>` that functions "
"like ``url_title()`` but automatically escapes and extended URL "
"characters."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:33
msgid ":doc:`Image library </libraries/images>` now supports ``webp`` images."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:34
msgid "Added Unicode support for regular expressions in the Router."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:35
msgid ""
"Added support for removing hidden folders in the :doc:`delete_files() "
"</helpers/filesystem_helper>` helper."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:36
msgid ""
"``fetchGlobal()`` in the Request class now supports applying filters to "
"arrays of data, not just the first item."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:37
msgid "``file`` validation now works with arrays of files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:38
msgid ""
"URI class now supports a ``setSilent()`` method that will disable the "
"throwing of Exceptions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:39
msgid ""
"New argument to ``URI::getSegment()`` that allows us to change the "
"default value returned if nothing exists."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:40
msgid ""
"Implemented a ``withResource()`` in Image so that you can use method "
"chaining instead of using the provided getResource() (used in tests). To "
"just compress your image."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:41
msgid ""
"Cookies and headers can be copied from the global Response object when "
"doing a redirect using the new ``withCookies()`` and ``withHeaders()`` "
"methods."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:42
msgid ""
"Support for special prefix \"hex2bin:\" which can be used with ``$key`` "
"parameter in :doc:`Encryption class</libraries/encryption>` or in .env "
"file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:45
msgid "Bugs Fixed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:47
msgid ""
"Fixed location for the SQLite3 database which by default will be now "
"located in a ``writable`` folder instead of the ``public`` folder."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:48
msgid "Fixed bug where ``force_https()`` could add ``https://`` a second time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:49
msgid ""
"Fixed a bug with CurlRequest that could result in incorrect \"100 "
"Continue\" headers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:50
msgid "Image::save() bug fixed when ``$target`` parameter was ``null``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:51
msgid ""
"fixes for ``set_checkbox()`` and ``set_radio()`` when the $default "
"parameter is set to ``true``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:52
msgid "fix for result object handling in Model class."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:53
msgid "fixed escape character SQLite database."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:54
msgid "fix for inserts on Postgres and Entities when the primary key was null."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:55
msgid "CLI scripts can now correctly recognize dashes within arguments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:56
msgid "CURLRequest now properly sets content length with multipart data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:57
msgid "Misc. stability improvements for the ImageMagick handler."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:58
msgid "setting validation errors within a config file should now work."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:59
msgid "Unicode characters are not escaped when saving JSON from Entities."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:60
msgid "redirecting with a custom HTTP code should work correctly now."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:61
msgid "``Time::setTimezone()`` now working correctly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:62
msgid "added full outer join support for Postgres."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:63
msgid ""
"some cast items in the Entity (like array, json) were not being set "
"correctly during a ``fill()`` process."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:64
msgid ""
"Fixed bug in Image GD handler that would try to compress images twice in "
"certain cases."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:65
msgid ""
"Ensure get translation output logic work on selected locale, dashed "
"locale, and fallback \"en\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:66
msgid ""
"Fix ``is_unique``/``is_not_unique`` validation called on POST/PUT via API"
" in PostgreSQL."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:67
msgid "Fixed a bug where filter arguments were not passed to ``after()``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.4.rst:69
msgid ""
"See the repo's `CHANGELOG_4.0.md "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/changelogs/CHANGELOG_4.0.md>`_"
" for a complete list of bugs fixed."
msgstr ""

